# The window at (-20, -20): headless Ozone's pointer is always at (0, 0), so
# it is over the window, clear of its 8 px edges, as a person's pointer is
# after clicking a menu item. A closed menu's sidebar hold lets go at once
# then (SidebarHold::ReleaseWhenPointerMoves()), as with real input.
--window-position=-20,-20
